er said, \\\"The earth revolves around the sun.\\\"\", \"questionType\": \"multiple_choice\", \"showExplanation\": true, \"questionImageUrl\": null}, {\"id\": \"question-1787069700473-208\", \"title\": \"Question 5\", \"points\": 1, \"choices\": [{\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1645\", \"text\": \"He said that he had failed.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1646\", \"text\": \"He exclaimed with sorrow that he had failed.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": true}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1647\", \"text\": \"He exclaimed with joy that he had failed.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1648\", \"text\": \"He said alas he failed.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}], \"collapsed\": false, \"explanation\": \"\\\"Alas!\\\" expresses sorrow. In indirect exclamatory sentences, the reporting verb changes to \\\"exclaimed with sorrow\\\" and present perfect \\\"have failed\\\" becomes past perfect \\\"had failed.\\\"\", \"questionText\": \"He said, \\\"Alas! I have failed.\\\"\", \"questionType\": \"multiple_choice\", \"showExplanation\": true, \"questionImageUrl\": null}, {\"id\": \"question-1787069700473-209\", \"title\": \"Question 6\", \"points\": 1, \"choices\": [{\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1653\", \"text\": \"She said please help me.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1654\", \"text\": \"She requested me to help her.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": true}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1655\", \"text\": \"She asked me help her.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1656\", \"text\": \"She requested that I help me.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}], \"collapsed\": false, \"explanation\": \"Imperative sentences with \\\"please\\\" are reported using \\\"requested\\\"; object \\\"me\\\" changes to \\\"her\\\"; verb takes \\\"to + base form.\\\"\", \"questionText\": \"She said, \\\"Please help me.\\\"\", \"questionType\": \"multiple_choice\", \"showExplanation\": true, \"questionImageUrl\": null}, {\"id\": \"question-1787069700473-210\", \"title\": \"Question 7\", \"points\": 1, \"choices\": [{\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1661\", \"text\": \"He asked me not to make a noise.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1662\", \"text\": \"He told me not to make a noise.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": true}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1663\", \"text\": \"He said to me not to make a noise.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1664\", \"text\": \"He requested me to not make a noise.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}], \"collapsed\": false, \"explanation\": \"In negative imperative, \\\"said to\\\" changes to \\\"told/ordered\\\"; negative infinitive \\\"not to make\\\" is used.\", \"questionText\": \"He said to me, \\\"Don\'t make a noise.\\\"\", \"questionType\": \"multiple_choice\", \"showExplanation\": true, \"questionImageUrl\": null}, {\"id\": \"question-1787069700473-211\", \"title\": \"Question 8\", \"points\": 1, \"choices\": [{\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1669\", \"text\": \"She said that she saw him yesterday.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1670\", \"text\": \"She said that she had seen him the previous day.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": true}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1671\", \"text\": \"She said that she has seen him the previous day.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}, {\"id\": \"choice-1787069700473-1672\", \"text\": \"She said that she had seen him yesterday.\", \"imageUrl\": null, \"isCorrect\": false}], \"collapsed\": false, \"explanation\": \"Past simple \\\"saw\\\" changes to past perfect \\\"had seen\\\"; \\\"yesterday\\\" changes to \\\"the previous day\\\" or \\\"the day before.\\\"\", \"questionText\": \"She said, \\\"I saw him yesterday.