_choice\", \"showExplanation\": true, \"questionImageUrl\": null}], \"storageKey\": \"71\", \"totalPoints\": 10}',1,5,'2026-08-18 16:15:00','2026-09-01 15:44:57',NULL,NULL,'2026-09-01 15:44:57',1);
